WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.492
Reflection is structured review, not vague rumination.

00:00:02.492 --> 00:00:07.276
It asks what happened, why it happened, what was assumed, what evidence was used,

00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:10.693
what changed, and what should be done differently next time.

00:00:10.693 --> 00:00:12.743
Reflection turns experience into reusable learning.

00:00:12.743 --> 00:00:13.426
Without it,

00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:17.868
people may repeat events without extracting the pattern that would improve future performance.

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:20.943
Self-explanation is one of the most practical reflection tools.

00:00:20.943 --> 00:00:24.702
Instead of only naming the answer, explain why the answer works,

00:00:24.702 --> 00:00:27.777
why a step matters, or why an error happened.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:28.802
In technical work,

00:00:28.802 --> 00:00:33.244
this might mean explaining why one root cause is more likely than another.

00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:37.686
In writing, it might mean explaining why a section supports the main claim.

00:00:37.686 --> 00:00:41.445
In leadership, it might mean explaining why a message created confusion.

00:00:41.445 --> 00:00:43.495
Comparing predictions to outcomes strengthens reflection.

00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:47.937
Before acting, make a prediction: what do I expect to happen, and why?

00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:49.304
Afterward, compare the result.

00:00:49.304 --> 00:00:54.088
If the outcome matched, ask whether the reasoning was actually sound or merely lucky.

00:00:54.088 --> 00:00:57.163
If it did not match, ask which assumption failed.

00:00:57.163 --> 00:01:00.580
This habit improves judgment because it connects thinking to evidence.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.288
Personal after-action reviews, learning journals,

00:01:02.288 --> 00:01:04.680
and decision notes can make reflection easier.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:07.072
They do not need to be elaborate.

00:01:07.072 --> 00:01:11.856
Record the goal, the approach, the uncertainty, the result, the feedback, and the adjustment.

00:01:11.856 --> 00:01:15.273
Over time, those notes reveal recurring gaps and useful patterns.

00:01:15.273 --> 00:01:20.740
Reflection becomes less about criticizing yourself and more about building a memory system for better work.
